        "notes": "**Warning: Contains Blood, Suicide, Violence, Psychological Horror, and Tension**\r\nThis story features an emotionally and mentally intense atmosphere. The content includes bloody\r\nscenes, elements of violence, characters experiencing physical and emotional harm, suicide\r\nthemes, psychological horror, and tension. Throughout the story, the mental breakdown of\r\ncharacters, fear-filled environments, blurred lines between reality and hallucination, and terrifying\r\nexperiments are detailed.\r\n**Blood and Violence:**\r\n- The scenes depict bloody imagery, corpses, and physical violence. Graphic descriptions of\r\ngruesome murders and dead bodies are prominent.\r\n- There are instances where characters harm each other or engage in violent actions. These scenes\r\nare disturbing and include graphic details.\r\n**Psychological Horror:**\r\n- As the protagonist begins to lose his sanity, the reader embarks on a psychological horror journey\r\nalongside him.\r\n- The gradual depiction of mental breakdown, paranoia, and hallucinations is conveyed in detail.\r\n- The distorted perception of reality keeps both the characters and the readers in a constant state of\r\nuncertainty.\r\n**Suicide and Despair:**\r\n- The theme of suicide is prominent in several scenes, forming a significant part of the plot. The\r\ndespair and mental pain of characters are explicitly portrayed.\r\n- This element is intertwined with dramatic scenes of depression, loneliness, and hopelessness,\r\ncreating a heavy atmosphere.\r\n**Tension and Mystery:**\r\n- The story's atmosphere is built on a persistent sense of threat and ambiguity. Characters grapple\r\nwith external dangers and their inner demons.\r\n- Suspense, fear, and mystery draw the reader deeper into the narrative.\r\n**Note:** These elements can be triggering for sensitive individuals. It is recommended to consider\r\nyour personal limits while engaging with the story."
    },
